  dialogueLines:
  - subtitleText: Here lay the individual graves of Xavier Delouvroy and Albert Platteau,
      who died in May 1945. Historical aerial photos show that during the camp's
      existence, potato and beet pits were located exactly in this area, which then
      served as burial sites.
